    "updated_at": "2025-07-22T08:23:47Z",
    "body": "I've checked some Node's WebAPIs, but so far I cannot find any affected cases.\r\n`arguments.length` is checked by constructors and operations, but not by setters.\r\nSo I'll mark it unaffected for now.\r\nPlease correct me if I'm wrong.\r\n",
